&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&#34;more&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;value-centric-web3-red-teaming-mitre-aadapt-技术笔记&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#value-centric-web3-red-teaming-mitre-aadapt-技术笔记&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; Value-Centric Web3 Red Teaming (MITRE AADAPT) 技术笔记&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!summary] 提炼定位&lt;br /&gt;
面向 &lt;strong&gt;防御检测与 OPSEC&lt;/strong&gt; 的知识点；已剥离原仓库目录、构建说明、站点资产和安装噪声，只保留概念、流程、命令、工具、方法论与检测线索。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;适用场景&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#适用场景&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 适用场景&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;围绕 Value-Centric Web3 Red Teaming (MITRE AADAPT) 技术笔记 建立检测、规避、溯源或 OPSEC 检查。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;把行为、进程链、网络、文件、日志事件转化为可验证线索。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;中文提炼&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#中文提炼&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 中文提炼&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;核心目标是围绕 &lt;strong&gt;Value-Centric Web3 Red Teaming (MITRE AADAPT) 技术笔记&lt;/strong&gt; 建立行为证据、检测逻辑和操作暴露面。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;优先关注：Value-Centric Web3 Red Teaming (MITRE AADAPT)、Inventory value-bearing components、Map components to AADAPT behaviors、Prioritize by attacker feasibility vs. business impact、Execute in controlled, production-realistic environments；把命令、进程、文件、网络、注册表 / 日志事件映射到检测字段。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;区分正常管理行为与攻击行为，避免只按工具名告警；优先写可复现的查询条件。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OPSEC 记录应包括噪声来源、持久化痕迹、清理步骤和不可规避风险。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;本页当前以概念和流程为主；后续实验时可补充最小复现命令和输出样例。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;关键主题&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#关键主题&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 关键主题&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value-Centric Web3 Red Teaming (MITRE AADAPT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory value-bearing components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map components to AADAPT behaviors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize by attacker feasibility vs. business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute in controlled, production-realistic environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telemetry aligned with AADAPT techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Purple-team loop &amp;amp; maturity metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenario templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenario A – Flash-loan economic manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenario B – Oracle/data-feed poisoning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenario C – Credential/signing abuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenario D – Cross-chain 规避 &amp;amp; traceability gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;核心要点&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#核心要点&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 核心要点&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-chain protocol logic&lt;/strong&gt; handling lending, AMMs, vaults, staking, bridges, or settlement rails. Document the invariants they assume (oracle prices, collateral ratios, rebalance cadence…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the AADAPT taxonomy into concrete attack candidates per component.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational weaknesses&lt;/strong&gt;: exposed CI 凭据，over-privileged IAM roles, misconfigured KMS policies, automation accounts that can request arbitrary signatures, public buckets with bridge configs, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-specific weaknesses&lt;/strong&gt;: fragile oracle parameters, upgradable contracts without multi-party approvals, flash-loan sensitive liquidity, governance actions that 绕过 timelocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument telemetry streams so every scenario produces actionable 检测 data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chain-level traces&lt;/strong&gt;: full call graphs, gas usage, transaction nonces, block timestamps—to reconstruct flash-loan bundles, reentrancy-like structures, and cross-contract hops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anomaly markers&lt;/strong&gt;: derived metrics such as slippage spikes, abnormal collateralization ratios, unusual gas density, or cross-chain velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;: Do KMS/HSM logs raise anomaly alerts (time-of-day, destination drift, burst of high-risk operations)? Can policies or multisig thresholds prevent unilateral abuse? Are throttles/rate limits or additional approvals enforced?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;: Time to correlate events across telemetry + commercial chain analytics, completeness of the reconstructed path, ability to identify choke points for freezing in a real incident, and alert fidelity for abnormal cross-chain velocity/value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;工具与参考入口&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#工具与参考入口&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 工具与参考入口&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
